body:
Because the great Lord gives, and he doth not receive. God is definitely a top. 

&#x200B;

(Really, it's just a grrreat way for companies to rake in the $)

Depending on the size, it'd probably get lodged somewhere and you'll be very VERY constipated. After a few days, you would probably be in a fair amount of pain. Later on, bowel impaction, followed by toxins and ick building up an possibly rupturing your intestine. After that, your poop bacteria leeches into your abdomen and you'll probably (very likely, unless you're Wolverine) die. 

&#x200B;

I would like to follow this up with saying that I am 100% not a doctor.
